	<element name="Indomitable" type="Class Feature" source="System Reference Document 5.1" id="ID_SRD_CLASS_FEATURE_FIGHTER_INDOMITABLE">
		<description><p>You can reroll a saving throw that you fail, and must use the new roll. You can use this once between long rests, twice from 13th level and three times from 17th level.</p></description>
