	<element name="Superior Critical" type="Archetype Feature" source="System Reference Document 5.1" id="ID_SRD_ARCHETYPE_FEATURE_CHAMPION_SUPERIOR_CRITICAL">
		<description><p>Your weapon attacks score a critical hit on a roll of 18–20.</p></description>
	</element>

	<element name="Survivor" type="Archetype Feature" source="System Reference Document 5.1" id="ID_SRD_ARCHETYPE_FEATURE_CHAMPION_SURVIVOR">
		<description><p>At the start of each of your turns, you regain hit points equal to 5 + your Constitution modifier if you have no more than half your hit points left. You don’t gain this benefit if you have 0 hit points.</p></description>
	</element>

